        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: DAF XF, DAF truck models\n- Companies: DAF, Leyland Trucks\n- Places: Netherlands, UK, Leyland, Preston, England, Farington plant\n\nFacts:\n- DAF has produced the DAF XF range of trucks since 1997.\n- All right-hand-drive versions of the DAF XF are assembled by Leyland Trucks in the UK.\n- Some truck models sold under the DAF brand are designed and built by Leyland Trucks at the Farington plant in Leyland near Preston, England.",
